"Image generation stays on this device. Prompt assistance uses your selected provider." = "圖像在此裝置上產生。提示詞助手使用所選供應商。";
"Prompt assistance runs on this device using the selected language GGUF model, which is separate from Anima." = "提示詞助手使用另外選擇的本機 GGUF 語言模型，與 Anima 圖像模型不同。";
"Prompt assistance sends text to your LM Studio server. Generated images are not sent to it." = "提示詞助手會將文字傳送到你的 LM Studio 伺服器，不會傳送產生的圖像。";
"Prompt assistance sends text to the selected API provider and may use paid credits. Generated images are not uploaded." = "提示詞助手會將文字傳送到所選 API 供應商，可能消耗付費額度。產生的圖像不會上傳。";
"DeepL translates text but cannot create or enhance anime prompts. Choose a language-model provider in Settings." = "DeepL 只能翻譯文字，無法建立或細化動漫提示詞。請在設定中選擇語言模型供應商。";
"Check the LM Studio server address in Settings." = "請在設定中檢查 LM Studio 伺服器位址。";
"Download Anima models on a supported device before generating images." = "請先在支援的裝置上下載 Anima 模型，再產生圖像。";
"The provider returned an invalid anime prompt. Your original prompt was kept." = "供應商傳回無效的動漫提示詞。原始提示詞已保留。";
"The suggestion is in English for Anima. Check names, appearance and clothing before applying it. Your original prompt stays unchanged until you choose Use prompt." = "建議提示詞使用適合 Anima 的英語。請檢查姓名、外觀及服裝。選擇使用提示詞前，原文不會改變。";
"Your prompt changed while the suggestion was open. Request a new suggestion to keep your latest edits." = "檢查建議期間提示詞已變更。請重新取得建議以保留最新編輯。";
"Invalid structured text request" = "結構化文字請求無效";
"1. Select a provider and language model in Settings. For local GGUF, download and select a language model separately from the Anima image model." = "1. 在設定中選擇供應商和語言模型。使用本機 GGUF 時，需要下載並選擇獨立的語言模型，它與 Anima 圖像模型不同。";
"2. Describe the image in your language. Enhance prompt keeps your subject, names, appearance, outfit and pose while adding compatible lighting, composition and background details." = "2. 用你熟悉的語言描述圖像。細化提示詞會保留主體、姓名、外觀、服裝和姿勢，並補充合適的光線、構圖和背景。";
"3. Random character proposes either an existing anime character with their series, or a new original character. This creates a prompt, not an image." = "3. 隨機角色可推薦附作品名稱的既有動漫角色，或全新原創角色。這一步只建立提示詞，不產生圖像。";
"4. Review and edit the English suggestion. Use prompt replaces the editor only when you choose it; Use and generate also starts Anima. Cancel keeps your original text." = "4. 檢查並編輯英文建議。選擇使用提示詞才會取代編輯器內容；使用並產生還會立即啟動 Anima。取消可保留原文。";
"5. Check character details before generating. Keep the app in the foreground while Anima works; loading and image generation can take several minutes. Stop is cooperative and may finish the current phase first." = "5. 產生圖像前請檢查角色細節。Anima 執行時請將應用程式保持在前景；載入和產生可能需要幾分鐘。停止可能需要等待目前階段結束。";
"Invalid image generation settings" = "圖像產生設定無效";
"Image settings" = "圖像設定";
"More steps may improve detail, but generation takes longer. Anima Turbo can reach its best quality with fewer steps; more is not always sharper." = "增加步數可能改善細節，但會耗時更久。Anima Turbo 可能在較少步數時達到最佳品質，並非步數越多就越清晰。";
"Larger images have more pixels and need more time and RAM. Start with 512 × 512; a larger size may not fit your device's available memory." = "大圖像的像素更多，需要更多時間和記憶體。建議從 512 × 512 開始；較大的尺寸可能超出裝置的可用記憶體。";
